Package: rustcache-client
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Traineratwot <Traineratwot@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/Traineratwot/RustCache
Depends: libc6, libgcc-s1
Description: Desktop client for the RustCache caching proxy
 Cross-platform desktop client for RustCache: root CA install, system proxy
 on/off, resilient local proxy (direct fail-open) and a status GUI.
 .
 Run `rustcache-client gui` for the status window, or
 `rustcache-client run --mode system` for proxy + system capture.
